We talked about this research, the origins of genius. The most successful artists, the most successful scientists in history are also the ones who have failed the most times.

549
01:18:10,170 --> 01:18:19,130
You have the most duds. It's the Edisons, it's the Da Vinci's, it's the Michelangelo's, it's the Marie Curie. The most successful scientists and artists have also failed the most.

550
01:18:19,770 --> 01:18:30,940
And finally, Jane Clem, who did research on people's success in dieting or people's success in starting an exercise regime.

551
01:18:30,940 --> 01:18:35,160
What she found was that the most successful people, people who have been able to persist,

552
01:18:35,520 --> 01:18:47,240
are people who have failed on average five times before. So I've been on five diets and haven't succeeded. The fifth one or the sixth one, I'm successful and I'm able to sustain it.

553
01:18:47,420 --> 01:18:49,080
The same with an exercise regime.

554
01:18:49,620 --> 01:18:52,620
Learn to fail or fail to learn. See you on Thursday.
